{"id":"6b9047014ff57a68","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_QuasiCategory.md","title":"QuasiCategory","display":"QuasiCategory","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"QuasiCategory","parameters":["X","R"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"QuasiCategory"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>X</span><span>R</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：小拟范畴语义。有序参数：<code>X</code>、<code>R</code>。</p>\n<p>小拟范畴的集合参数语义；不是全部拟范畴组成的集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ QuasiCategory X R)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ SimplicialSet X R)\n  (forall n\n    (forall k\n      (forall h\n        (implies\n          (@ InnerHorn X R n k h)\n          (exists N\n            (exists a\n              (exists J\n                (and\n                  (@ App X n N)\n                  (and\n                    (in a N)\n                    (and (@ Dom h J) (forall i (implies (in i J) (exists b (and (@ App h i b) (@ SimpFace X R n i a b))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"77a3b1b0b64f2abf\" href=\"?note=77a3b1b0b64f2abf\" title=\"ZFC_Dom\">Dom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"48e0b8a78d35938f\" href=\"?note=48e0b8a78d35938f\" title=\"ZFC_InnerHorn\">InnerHorn</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6ead27971b185ffe\" href=\"?note=6ead27971b185ffe\" title=\"ZFC_SimpFace\">SimpFace</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"85c9ab4a34ec968f\" href=\"?note=85c9ab4a34ec968f\" title=\"ZFC_SimplicialSet\">SimplicialSet</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ QuasiCategory X R)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Dom|Dom]]；[[ZFC_InnerHorn|InnerHorn]]；[[ZFC_SimpFace|SimpFace]]；[[ZFC_SimplicialSet|SimplicialSet]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Dom","status":"resolved","id":"77a3b1b0b64f2abf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Dom|Dom]]；[[ZFC_InnerHorn|InnerHorn]]；[[ZFC_SimpFace|SimpFace]]；[[ZFC_SimplicialSet|SimplicialSet]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_InnerHorn","status":"resolved","id":"48e0b8a78d35938f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Dom|Dom]]；[[ZFC_InnerHorn|InnerHorn]]；[[ZFC_SimpFace|SimpFace]]；[[ZFC_SimplicialSet|SimplicialSet]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_SimpFace","status":"resolved","id":"6ead27971b185ffe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Dom|Dom]]；[[ZFC_InnerHorn|InnerHorn]]；[[ZFC_SimpFace|SimpFace]]；[[ZFC_SimplicialSet|SimplicialSet]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_SimplicialSet","status":"resolved","id":"85c9ab4a34ec968f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Dom|Dom]]；[[ZFC_InnerHorn|InnerHorn]]；[[ZFC_SimpFace|SimpFace]]；[[ZFC_SimplicialSet|SimplicialSet]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":1261,"backlinks":[{"id":"f8f4015d1e8911d1","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_QuasiCategory|QuasiCategory]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-714","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_QuasiCategory|QuasiCategory]]"},{"id":"d203766cc7ddd76d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_QuasiCategory|QuasiCategory]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","8bd25e131370b9c4","77a3b1b0b64f2abf","48e0b8a78d35938f","6ead27971b185ffe","85c9ab4a34ec968f","593f9bdab4d60707"]}